just for this.

293
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:44,200
Sister, I haven't finished reading your palm yet.

294
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:44,960
Sister, listen to me first.

295
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:45,360
No.

296
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,400
Listen to me first.

297
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:48,760
Let's read the palm first.

298
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:51,000
I'm reading the palm.

299
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:51,800
Come closer.

300
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:52,480
You're not in the frame.

301
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,560
You are truly blessed.

302
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:54,560
I know.

303
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:56,360
See if there are any peach blossoms in my palm.

304
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:56,760
Sister,

305
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:58,120
look at your peach blossoms.

306
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:59,320
There are quite a few.

307
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:00,360
These are all peach blossoms.

308
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,440
How could they be lotuses?

309
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,160
Is that so?

310
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:02,640
Hello?

311
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:03,920
What's wrong?

312
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:04,599
Old Wu.

313
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:05,720
Unexpected Life.

314
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,319
Do you know about that variety show?

315
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,680
I need to take two days off.

316
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:09,920
Jin Xi is going to participate in it.

317
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,650
So suddenly?

318
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:12,920
Didn't I tell you a long time ago?

319
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,480
What's wrong with your memory?

320
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,839
Buy some supplements

321
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:17,099
to nourish your brain.

322
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,480
Okay.

323
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:20,079
By the way,

324
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,760
as for the close friend,

325
00:17:21,760 --> 00:17:24,020
pick one from your theater troupe for me.

326
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:25,560
Close friend?

327
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:26,880
Anyway, no matter what,

328
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:27,880
before noon tomorrow,

329
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:30,720
you must choose someone from your troupe to be the close friend.

330
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:31,080
Okay.

331
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:31,680
That's it.

332
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:37,120
'An Unexpected Life'.

333
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:42,040
I am especially grateful to the program team

334
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:43,840
for giving me this opportunity.

335
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:46,400
Because coming to this farmhouse courtyard

336
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:47,800
reminds me of many things

337
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,200
from my childhood.

338
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:52,660
My grandmother's house was similar to this courtyard.

339
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,740
I remember there was a big yellow dog.

340
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,880
It even bit you.

341
00:17:57,120 --> 00:17:58,560
Because we grew up together,

342
00:17:58,560 --> 00:17:59,600
and have been friends since childhood,

343
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:02,120
so I feel this bond will never change.

344
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:03,980
You're just putting on an act now.

345
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:05,320
What do you mean?

346
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:06,720
How am I putting on an act?

347
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:07,800
You know it yourself.

348
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:09,280
Because he has been away for so long

349
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:11,600
and hasn't contacted us,

350
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:14,120
we might have drifted apart.

351
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:15,320
Brother,

352
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:17,250
you will always be my good brother.

353
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,280
Jinxi

354
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:26,320
is going to record a variety show,

355
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:29,300
and wants to find a close friend from our troupe.

356
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:31,260
After careful consideration...

357
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:34,000
I think our Heying is the most suitable.

358
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:36,840
You two look like a good team on stage,

359
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:39,880
and interact a lot off stage.

360
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,880
Does Jinxi have no friends?

361
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,560
Does she have to find someone from our troupe?

362
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:46,040
This is a hit S-tier variety show.

363
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:47,800
If our Heying goes on it,

364
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:51,800
it will also be great promotion for our troupe.

365
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:52,480
No.

366
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:55,440
Both my A and B cast for Ning Caichen are leaving.

367
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:57,560
How can I rehearse this play without a lead actor?

368
00:18:57,560 --> 00:18:59,640
Why can't you rehearse?

369
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,760
Aren't there still the Black Mountain Demon

370
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,680
and those monsters?

371
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:08,440
Actually, as the star of Xiyin Troupe,

372
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:10,160
I don't mind going on a variety show

373
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:11,200
to promote our troupe.

374
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,000
That's great!

375
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:13,280
But,

376
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:15,880
the show Unexpected Life is no good.

377
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:18,440
This show seems real and simple,

378
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:20,000
but it is actually pretentious and hypocritical.

379
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:20,920
The concept it wants to convey is okay.

380
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:21,120
Stop.

381
00:19:21,120 --> 00:19:21,780
Simply put,

382
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,240
there's no need to say so much.

383
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,640
You just don't want to go.

384
00:19:29,280 --> 00:19:30,600
This young man.

385
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:32,800
I knew you wouldn't want to go.

386
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:36,360
Good thing I planned ahead.

387
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,440
Get ready for

388
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:39,280
Plan B.

389
00:19:39,280 --> 00:19:40,410
I am willing to do it.

390
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:42,360
Rest assured.

391
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:42,880
Mr. Wu,

392
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,360
I know this is a very important

393
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:46,080
promotional opportunity for our troupe.

394
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:47,760
I will not let you down.

395
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:53,880
It is a great comfort to have such

396
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:56,300
a sensible actress in our troupe.

397
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:58,160
Jin.

398
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,880
Mr. Wu and I have already agreed.

399
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:01,600
While we are away,

400
00:20:01,600 --> 00:20:02,720
for the roles of Nie Xiaoqian and Ning Caichen,

401
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:04,400
you and Heying will pair up.

402
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:05,760
How is that possible?

403
00:20:05,760 --> 00:20:06,960
Why is it impossible?

404
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:09,000
We are not asking you to perform on stage.

405
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,120
Just partner up for rehearsal for a few days.

406
00:20:11,120 --> 00:20:15,000
The theater troupe isn't just about rehearsing.

407
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:18,200
Promotion is also a very important job.

408
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:27,680
A pinch of salt.

409
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:29,560
Yes, the host Liu Ding.

410
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,560
Can you get an autographed photo for me?

411
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:33,000
My dad really likes her.

412
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,200
I get it.

413
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:37,340
Elegant, poised, and intellectual types like her.

414
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:39,960
Don't worry.

415
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:41,320
I'll ask for it as soon as I see her.

416
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:42,400
No problem.

417
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:44,320
You're so sweet.

418
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:46,730
Come and eat.

419
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:50,320
Jinxi.

420
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:52,240
What are you looking at?

421
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:53,080
Nothing.

422
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:54,640
Come have some dessert.

423
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:55,440
Dessert?

424
00:20:55,800 --> 00:20:56,720
Jealous?

425
00:20:58,280 --> 00:21:01,160
This is an exclusive perk of the Xiyin Troupe.

426
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:04,600
They're low-calorie, low-sugar cakes specially made by Ning Jin.

427
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:05,400
Is it good?

428
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:07,240
It's delicious.

429
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,280
You made all these?

430
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:09,280
She made them all.

431
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,880
Do you know who's sitting in front of you?

432
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:15,400
She is Xiyin Troupe's top chef, Ning Jin.

433
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:18,160
These desserts are just the tip of the iceberg.

434
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,800
Her cooking is the real deal.

435
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:21,680
She's mastered all eight culinary traditions.

436
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:22,360
The craziest part is

437
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:23,480
that she can single-handedly

438
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:26,080
cook 14 or 15 dishes for the whole troupe.

439
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:29,320
Flavors from all over the country are a piece of cake for her.

440
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:30,760
A piece of cake.

441
00:21:30,760 --> 00:21:31,760
That's only because

442
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:33,600
not a single one of you can be my sous-chef.

443
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:35,080
That's because you are too picky.

444
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:35,480
You think

445
00:21:35,480 --> 00:21:36,800
none of us can do anything right.

446
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:39,360
You kick us out over the slightest mistake.

447
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:41,240
Putting cooking wine in the pot instead of soy sauce

448
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:42,080
is not a small mistake.

449
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:42,560
Exactly.

450
00:21:42,560 --> 00:21:43,720
Eating too much of it will kill you.

451
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:44,960
People could die.

452
00:21:46,560 --> 00:21:47,160
Director.

453
00:21:47,320 --> 00:21:49,320
Boss Wu is looking for you and Jinxi.

454
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:53,480
Why can't our Bai Feixin do it?

455
00:21:53,480 --> 00:21:56,160
Bai Feixin has ulterior motives towards our Jinxi.

456
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,200
He's always trying to piggyback off her.

457
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:59,400
There are rumors about the two of them all over the internet right now.

458
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,400
If they go together,

459
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,760
won't that just add fuel to the fire?

460
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:03,240
We're all adults here.

461
00:22:03,360 --> 00:22:05,160
Hyping them up as a couple won't kill anyone.

462
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:07,480
Don't you know Jinxi's positioning?

463
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:08,280
I don't know.

464
00:22:08,280 --> 00:22:09,040
Hype my foot!

465
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:10,880
Hype my foot!

466
00:22:11,480 --> 00:22:12,960
That sounds like a dish name.

467
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:14,220
Just watch your video.

468
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:21,480
Director,

469
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,200
why don't you go?

470
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:25,640
Let that Xiao Ba from your troupe lead the rehearsal.

471
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:27,840
That minimizes the impact, doesn't it?

472
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:28,800
I'm not going.

473
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,000
As long as you go,

474
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:32,530
I can talk to the show's crew

475
00:22:33,280 --> 00:22:35,000
to schedule the broadcast

476
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:37,160
before your tour.

477
00:22:37,360 --> 00:22:39,220
It can also boost your box office.

478
00:22:39,560 --> 00:22:40,960
It's the same promotion.

479
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:44,080
What's the difference between me going and Bai Feixin going?

480
00:22:44,080 --> 00:22:46,000
Of course it's different.

481
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:48,800
Your musical qualifications are much better than hers.

482
00:22:48,800 --> 00:22:51,120
Besides, if she goes with Jinxi,

483
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:52,920
will anyone still focus on your work?

484
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,520
It'll be nothing but gossip.

485
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:56,320
Then if I go alone with the director,

486
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:58,180
there won't be any gossip, right?

487
00:22:58,800 --> 00:22:59,680
So it's settled.

488
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:01,210
I've unilaterally decided

489
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:05,160
to let Bai Feixin and Director Ning go together.

490
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,320
We can consider it.

491
00:23:08,560 --> 00:23:09,880
Are you kidding me?

492
00:23:10,320 --> 00:23:13,720
The production crew didn't say the best friend has to be just one person.

493
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:14,520
I'm not going.

494
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:18,480
Ning Jin.

495
00:23:19,280 --> 00:23:20,280
Do me a favor.

496
00:23:20,880 --> 00:23:21,810
I'm begging you.

497
00:23:25,280 --> 00:23:26,040
Fine.

498
00:23:28,360 --> 00:23:29,680
What's the worst that could happen?

499
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:31,680
A small theater troupe,

500
00:23:31,800 --> 00:23:33,400
with no promotional budget.

501
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:35,480
At worst, during performances,

502
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:36,680
the box office fails,

503
00:23:38,120 --> 00:23:39,520
and the troupe disbands.

504
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:40,560
I will

505
00:23:40,560 --> 00:23:42,120
sell everything I own

506
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:45,360
to give these kids some severance pay.

507
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:46,560
But...

508
00:23:47,560 --> 00:23:48,680
but these...

509
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:52,000
these young people...

510
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:54,170
their musical theater journey...

511
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:56,160
their path of pursuing art...

512
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,420
I'll go just this once.

513
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:58,240
It's a deal.

514
00:23:58,960 --> 00:24:00,220
What about Bai Feixin?

515
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:04,360
I'm still willing.

516
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:17,370
What do you want now?

517
00:24:17,560 --> 00:24:18,160
Director,

518
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:20,080
let me come in first.

519
00:24:20,080 --> 00:24:20,680
No.

520
00:24:21,360 --> 00:24:22,040
Tell me first,

521
00:24:22,040 --> 00:24:23,600
why did you come over without giving me a heads-up?

522
00:24:23,600 --> 00:24:24,400
Can you let me...

523
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,280
let me in first?

524
00:24:25,360 --> 00:24:26,080
No.

525
00:24:26,560 --> 00:24:27,620
I brought milk tea.

526
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:32,720
Who allowed you to just show up at my house for no reason?

527
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:34,360
I really have an emergency, Director.

528
00:24:34,360 --> 00:24:35,440
Please help me out.

529
00:24:37,360 --> 00:24:37,920
Come in.

530
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:39,680
Thank you, Director.

531
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:43,800
Cooking?

532
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:46,920
Previously in 'Unexpected Life',

533
00:24:46,920 --> 00:24:48,240
there was a cooking segment.

534
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:49,400
One guest said

535
00:24:49,400 --> 00:24:50,680
he was very good at cooking.

536
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:52,140
But no one ate what he made,

537
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:53,960
and he was mocked online for a long time.

538
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:54,800
Then why didn't you just tell them

539
00:24:54,800 --> 00:24:56,120
that you can't cook?

540
00:24:56,120 --> 00:24:57,440
The point is, I can.

541
00:24:57,920 --> 00:24:58,920
What can you make?

542
00:24:58,960 --> 00:25:00,400
Scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

543
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:01,000
What else?

544
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:03,380
Do instant noodles count?

545
00:25:03,800 --> 00:25:04,560
No.

546
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:06,100
Then that's it.

547
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:08,980
Then you don't know how to cook at all.

548
00:25:09,280 --> 00:25:11,320
So please help me, Director.

549
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:12,720
I can't go on the show

550
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,920
and make a table full of instant noodles

551
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:16,580
and scrambled eggs with tomatoes for everyone.

552
00:25:18,080 --> 00:25:19,140
Okay, come with me.

553
00:25:20,760 --> 00:25:21,800
Let's prepare the ingredients first,

554
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:23,000
scallion and ginger.

555
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:24,360
Then look.

556
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,960
Make sure your hands are like this.

557
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:27,920
Like this?

558
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:30,040
Yes, press it with your nails.

559
00:25:31,720 --> 00:25:32,650
You give it a try.

560
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:34,050
Hand.

561
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:35,720
Hook it like this.

562
00:25:38,360 --> 00:25:38,800
Right?

563
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:39,600
Right.

564
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:42,930
Are you okay?

565
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:45,720
Just kidding.

566
00:25:48,320 --> 00:25:49,120
Learn it well.

567
00:25:56,480 --> 00:25:57,560
You have to add it now.

568
00:25:57,560 --> 00:25:59,360
Otherwise, it won't taste good.

569
00:26:05,800 --> 00:26:06,400
Director,

570
00:26:07,080 --> 00:26:07,840
try it.

571
00:26:20,560 --> 00:26:21,320
How is it?

572
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:22,160
Not bad.

573
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:24,720
I told you.

574
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:26,250
I've made this dish before.

575
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:28,800
Come try this.

576
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:31,850
It's my first time making shredded potatoes.

577
00:26:35,480 --> 00:26:36,160
How is it?

578
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:38,500
It's a bit sour.

579
00:26:38,800 --> 00:26:40,060
I put too much vinegar.

580
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:43,280
Did you order takeout?

581
00:26:43,280 --> 00:26:44,320
Open the door.

582
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:45,560
Who is it?

583
00:26:45,880 --> 00:26:46,800
It's me,

584
00:26:47,640 --> 00:26:48,300
Bai Feixin.

585
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,300
Why is she here?

586
00:26:50,960 --> 00:26:51,960
Go hide inside quickly.

587
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:52,800
Hurry.

588
00:26:52,800 --> 00:26:53,530
Where is she?

589
00:26:55,760 --> 00:26:56,400
Feixin.

590
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:58,000
Ma has fallen for Zhiwei.

591
00:26:59,760 --> 00:27:00,560
Wait a minute.

592
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:02,320
Who is Ma?

593
00:27:02,320 --> 00:27:02,800
Ma,

594
00:27:02,800 --> 00:27:04,120
the newcomer to the group.

595
00:27:04,120 --> 00:27:05,360
The one with the big eyes,

596
00:27:05,360 --> 00:27:06,800
who played the innkeeper.

597
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:07,800
Are you close to her?

598
00:27:07,800 --> 00:27:08,760
That's not important now.

599
00:27:08,760 --> 00:27:09,480
What's important is Zhiwei.

600
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:10,320
He has someone he likes,

601
00:27:10,320 --> 00:27:11,720
and that person is Qianying.

602
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:13,120
But I can't tell Xiaoma,

603
00:27:13,120 --> 00:27:14,720
because I promised Zhiwei to keep it a secret.

604
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:16,080
Don't you think it's hard for me?

605
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:17,880
What's the relationship between Zhiwei and Qianying

606
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:18,680
now?

607
00:27:19,360 --> 00:27:20,160
That's a

608
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:21,400
long story.

609
00:27:21,560 --> 00:27:22,560
I'll tell you all about it in detail tonight

610
00:27:22,560 --> 00:27:24,640
when we're in bed.

611
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:26,530
You made so many dishes.

612
00:27:27,280 --> 00:27:28,760
I can help you eat some.

613
00:27:40,800 --> 00:27:41,400
Ning Jin.

614
00:27:43,560 --> 00:27:44,690
You've worked hard.

615
00:27:45,280 --> 00:27:46,000
I know

616
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:47,600
you usually eat alone at home

617
00:27:47,600 --> 00:27:48,530
and feel lonely.

618
00:27:48,800 --> 00:27:50,560
But instead of setting an extra set of tableware,

619
00:27:50,560 --> 00:27:52,420
why don't you find a real partner?

620
00:27:52,800 --> 00:27:54,130
Who said they're empty?

621
00:27:54,800 --> 00:27:56,360
I'm hiding a man in my house right now.

622
00:27:56,360 --> 00:27:57,000
He's right in my bedroom.

623
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:59,930
You'll see him if you open the door, believe it or not.

624
00:28:07,240 --> 00:28:10,040
I haven't heard anything this funny in a long time.

625
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:12,240
Eat.
